  "description": "BEJRUH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C34 H80 F9 N18 O18 Pr4 3+,C2 H1 F3 O2,3(C2 F3 O2 1-),6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr3 (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr4 (Pr) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.934-4.062 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.59-111.70°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C34 H80 F9 N18 O18 Pr4 · 3(C2 F3 O2) · C2 H F3 O2 · 6(H2 O).",
